{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast n Chill's a laid-back fishin\u2019 game for folks who\u2019d rather wet a line than break a sweat. Whether yer driftin\u2019 on a lazy lake, pokin\u2019 'round a winding river, or droppin\u2019 lines in salty blue water, this here\u2019s a game where you set the pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/fd1adf09d522b107d477258a462ad9f2.poster.avif?t=1757719812\" width=640 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/fd1adf09d522b107d477258a462ad9f2.webm?t=1757719812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/fd1adf09d522b107d477258a462ad9f2.mp4?t=1757719812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Yer Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the basics, catch whatever bites, sell your haul, and put those coins toward better rods, reels, and upgrades. Before ya know it, you\u2019ll be wranglin\u2019 <strong>rare species</strong> that\u2019d make any angler green with envy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/49919d8d3ad4d4a66630bbc5c3508f14.avif?t=1757719812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras_big/49919d8d3ad4d4a66630bbc5c3508f14.avif?t=1757719812 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore New Waters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find yer favourite fishin\u2019 hole or keep wanderin\u2019. There\u2019s <strong>15 peaceful spots to discover</strong>, each with its own critters swimmin\u2019 'round, just waitin\u2019 to bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/1a026253a1e34bde42b3ee120d426a9a.avif?t=1757719812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras_big/1a026253a1e34bde42b3ee120d426a9a.avif?t=1757719812 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Active Mode</strong></i>, you\u2019re in the thick of it - castin\u2019, reelin\u2019, and keepin\u2019 busy like a loon at nesting time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to <i><strong>Passive Mode</strong></i> if you\u2019d rather let the game do the work while you\u2019re off choppin\u2019 wood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set it up on a <strong>second monitor</strong> or <strong>tuck it in the corner</strong> - come back later and see what kind o\u2019 haul the fish gods left ya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/160d52ebb03f9b4f1ac3d674f4fb3e68.poster.avif?t=1757719812\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/160d52ebb03f9b4f1ac3d674f4fb3e68.webm?t=1757719812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/160d52ebb03f9b4f1ac3d674f4fb3e68.mp4?t=1757719812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect 'Em All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s  <strong>50+ fish to discover</strong> - some you\u2019ll recognize, some you\u2019ll squint at and go \u201cwhat in the heck is <i>that</i>?\u201d From scrappy little sunfish to big ol\u2019 deepwater beasts, they\u2019re all in the logbook waitin\u2019 for your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/c23ed356276e2c45ee7837b1eb68971a.avif?t=1757719812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras_big/c23ed356276e2c45ee7837b1eb68971a.avif?t=1757719812 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary Catches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s 13 fish out there that still get folks jabberin\u2019 at ol' Rusty's bait shop like they saw Bigfoot ride a moose. Land one, and you'll be part o' the legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/5014d53e1f91ce8c94ed6e7f5b102ea8.poster.avif?t=1757719812\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/5014d53e1f91ce8c94ed6e7f5b102ea8.webm?t=1757719812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/5014d53e1f91ce8c94ed6e7f5b102ea8.mp4?t=1757719812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boat Buddies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A day on the water\u2019s better with company. Bring along a trusty companion. They might not know a spinnerbait from a spoon, but they\u2019ll help you spot a fish - if only 'cause they\u2019re hopin\u2019 for a bite themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/51f1ebae0862210017874b5d5633e81b.avif?t=1757719812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras_big/51f1ebae0862210017874b5d5633e81b.avif?t=1757719812 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gone Fishin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/88065e8dd7db352cec857845ca37355860f34526.jpg"},{"name":"Rusty's No.1 Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/a70e061bb8851141e4af7fc85626934cca9f25bd.jpg"},{"name":"Fish Finder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/ceb758d6dabe72c47d85f3acccecf03b00320fa5.jpg"},{"name":"Fish Whisperer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/c7591a42a37e9c723dcf58fa5be1128cfd8e8c6c.jpg"},{"name":"Good Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/fb963550e3c53b5d2ce17756809fa3675bd651ee.jpg"},{"name":"Nap Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/00ac24dbf3ee663b6979331dd3836fe5fb431d27.jpg"},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/627203bbfd00021abf938b17248f8d3a7253e4d2.jpg"},{"name":"Above Board","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/90c01fce94a30f45544e021053100918f8e5b8ae.jpg"},{"name":"Over Achiever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/b981bd5260ca3debd079bd0ab475f414432d87d5.jpg"},{"name":"Whoa, Nelly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3483740/9b63a85a9cf0b3f5b178331dbb88ee620aee21c5.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483740?t=1757719812","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483740?t=1757719812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/201a148c3692e6d176fad750ed24acc8c6f5ee47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757719812","capsule_i