ies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A day on the water\u2019s better with company. Bring along a trusty companion. They might not know a spinnerbait from a spoon, but they\u2019ll help you spot a fish - if only 'cause they\u2019re hopin\u2019 for a bite themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras/51f1ebae0862210017874b5d5633e81b.avif?t=1757719812\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/extras_big/51f1ebae0862210017874b5d5633e81b.avif?t=1757719812 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Wombat Brawler"],"dlc":[4001650,3817870],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483740/060225195a8432c90ea7339e86570f287c72795b/header.jpg?t=1757719812","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Wombat Brawler 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2,6 GHz Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3483740/240568674/d940c681835364d44194d4f17fc0f439a63f1dfa/1750315702/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750089746","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3